      "text": "1) Big System\n\n2) simple to code change\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3) cost high (exponential inc.)\n\n4) ceiling\n\n5) downtime",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Big System\n\n2) simple to code change\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3) cost high (exponential inc.)\n\n4) ceiling\n\n5) downtime",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "07LjUemsTm5nPYToWyPFm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 457.09506636773233,
      "y": 933.6864186099756,
      "width": 415.51971435546875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 701862367,
      "version": 306,
      "versionNonce": 1940385599,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794810646701,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) More system\n\n2) complex to code change. when\n    horizantal come loadbalancer come \n    in the pitcher\n\nand statefull and stateless server problem\ncomes in the pitcher\n\n3) low cost (linear increase)\n\n4) No ceiling\n\n5) No downtime",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) More system\n\n2) complex to code change. when\n    horizantal come loadbalancer come \n    in the pitcher\n\nand statefull and stateless server problem\ncomes in the pitcher\n\n3) low cost (linear increase)\n\n4) No ceiling\n\n5) No downtime",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R0s-CtqeOzJ_vM4X_jFlM",
