    {
      "id": "0qx__hw__Bypa0oFnPdQn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1251.8285665725177,
      "y": 1017.4082709285738,
      "width": 586.2597045898438,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1680480895,
      "version": 487,
      "versionNonce": 726881215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794813846431,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But in Statefull server there have few problems\n(1) only one machine know about you.\n(2) if you req to another both machine they reject\n    the request\n(3) But when system one is busy to doing another task\n    then your req. wait when system are getting free then \n    they handle my req.\n\n    But same time system1, system2 are free but they don't\n    handle a req. because they dont know you \n    this is actually a big problem.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "But in Statefull server there have few problems\n(1) only one machine know about you.\n(2) if you req to another both machine they reject\n    the request\n(3) But when system one is busy to doing another task\n    then your req. wait when system are getting free then \n    they handle my req.\n\n    But same time system1, system2 are free but they don't\n    handle a req. because they dont know you \n    this is actually a big problem.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
